      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Adenocarcinoma of the small bowel is a rare tumor. The diagnosis is often tardy and surgical treatment is still palliative in most cases. A major interest toward this kind of tumor as well as an early diagnosis may give the opportunity to perform a radical operation allowing better results in terms of survival."},
